# Recon workspace: RECON.md (the frozen contract), the committed fixture
# set and the emulator gate checklist are tracked; probe captures and
# cloned third-party reference scrapers stay local
recon/*
!recon/RECON.md
!recon/EMULATOR_CHECK.md
!recon/fixtures
!recon/fixtures/**
